    "content": {
     "text": "<strong>description:</strong> a red field with the UK flag in the upper-left quadrant and the Bermudian coat of arms centered on the right half of the flag; the coat of arms is a white shield with a red lion on a green field, holding a scroll showing the sinking of the ship \"Sea Venture\" <br /><br /><strong>history:</strong> the 1609 shipwreck of the \"Sea Venture\" led to the settling of Bermuda",
